@startuml subsistema_backend
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

package "Backend Core (Rust)" {
  [Gestor SSH\n(ssh.rs / client.rs)] as SSH
  [Gestor SFTP\n(sftp.rs)] as SFTP
  [Prácticas\n(practicas.rs)] as Practicas
  [Gestor de Hosts\n(hosts.rs)] as Hosts
  [Módulo de Logs\n(logs.rs)] as Logs
  [Almacenamiento\n(storage.rs)] as Storage
  [Seguridad Múltiple\n(security.rs)] as Security
}

[Tauri API (IPC)] <--> SSH
[Tauri API (IPC)] <--> SFTP
[Tauri API (IPC)] <--> Practicas
[Tauri API (IPC)] <--> Hosts
[Tauri API (IPC)] <--> Logs
[Tauri API (IPC)] <--> Security

Hosts --> Storage
Storage --> Security
SSH --> Security : Uso de Claves Seguras

SSH --> [Servidor Remoto]
SFTP --> [Servidor Remoto]
@enduml
